flowchart TB
    subgraph Inputs["Three independent inputs"]
        E[Eᵢ — Biometric Entropy<br/>FaceID / TouchID / PUF]
        A[Aᵢ — Device Attestation<br/>AppAttest / Play Integrity]
        T[Tᵢ — Time Drift<br/>current block timestamp]
    end

    E & A & T --> H[Hash:<br/>SHAKE256 Eᵢ‖Aᵢ‖Tᵢ]
    H --> KDF[PQ-KDF<br/>Kyber-based]
    KDF --> S1[Share 1<br/>Secure Enclave]
    KDF --> S2[Share 2<br/>Secondary Device]
    KDF --> S3[Share 3<br/>Encrypted Cloud]

    S1 & S2 -.->|2-of-3 threshold| SK[SK reconstructed<br/>IN VOLATILE MEMORY ONLY]
    S3 -.->|Lagrange interp| SK
    
    SK --> SIGN[Sign transaction]
    SIGN --> WIPE[Memory wiped<br/>milliseconds later]

    style E fill:#0d1117,stroke:#58a6ff,color:#e6edf3
    style A fill:#0d1117,stroke:#58a6ff,color:#e6edf3
    style T fill:#0d1117,stroke:#58a6ff,color:#e6edf3
    style SK fill:#2d1a00,stroke:#f7931a,stroke-width:3px,color:#e6edf3
    style WIPE fill:#0d2e14,stroke:#3fb950,color:#e6edf3
